  "description": "Casa Bahía Dorada is a beautifully renovated beachfront home located in the sought-after Bahía Dorada community in Estepona. Positioned directly on the shoreline, this unique property offers uninterrupted views of the Mediterranean Sea and an exceptional setting for a relaxing holiday on the Costa del Sol.\n\nThe property comfortably accommodates up to 6 guests and features 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms. Designed to make the most of its privileged location, the home offers multiple outdoor spaces where guests can enjoy the sea views, sunshine and peaceful surroundings throughout the day.\n\nOne of the standout features of Casa Bahía Dorada is the spectacular rooftop terrace. Equipped with several sun loungers and a covered outdoor dining area, this elevated space provides panoramic views across the Mediterranean coastline and creates the perfect setting for relaxing, dining outdoors or simply enjoying the sea breeze.\n\nInside, the property has been tastefully renovated in a bright contemporary style. Large windows fill the living spaces with natural light while framing the stunning sea views. The open-plan kitchen and dining area provide a comfortable and sociable space for cooking, dining and spending time together with family and friends.\n\nAt ground level, guests can enjoy a private outdoor jacuzzi overlooking the beach and sea, offering a unique place to unwind after a day exploring the area. The beachfront location allows direct access to the shoreline, making it easy to enjoy morning walks along the coast or spend the day by the water.\n\nThe property also benefits from air conditioning, WiFi, private parking and all the comforts required for both short and extended stays.\n\nIdeally located just a short drive from Estepona Marina, the charming Old Town, golf courses, restaurants and local amenities, Casa Bahía Dorada combines an exceptional beachfront setting with easy access to everything the Costa del Sol has to offer.\n\n* Explore the Surroundings\n\nBeyond the tranquillity of Bahía Dorada, the property is perfectly positioned for discovering some of Southern Spain's most popular destinations.\n\n• Enjoy direct access to the Mediterranean coastline\n\n• Explore Estepona's charming Old Town and marina\n\n• Visit Marbella's boutiques, restaurants and beach clubs\n\n• Discover the traditional white villages of Andalusia\n\n• Play at some of the Costa del Sol's renowned golf courses\n\n• Experience the vibrant culture and gastronomy of Málaga\n\n• Visit Gibraltar and its famous Rock overlooking Africa\n\n• Enjoy a day trip to historic Ronda or Tarifa\n\nPlease note that we welcome families and couples only, no groups under 30, and no hen or stag parties. Should you fall outside of this category but wish to book nonetheless, please send us an enquiry detailing a bit more about yourself and the group that you will be travelling with so we can request this for you.\n\nDon’t forget to ask about our concierge service! We look forward to welcoming you.",
